    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.poster.avif?t=1751180193\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.webm?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.mp4?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It\u2019s New Year's Eve tonight, you know. Calendar says so. Wonder what Benny\u2019s up to these days. Haven\u2019t seen him in ages. Haven\u2019t heard from him neither. Hope he\u2019s alright.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourth Time Around</i>\u00a0is an experimental walking simulator in the style <span class=\"bb_strike\">of </span> You play as Henry, <span class=\"bb_strike\">an el\u00a0</span>suffering <span class=\"bb_strike\">fr </span>and must navigate a life-threatening home invasion on New Years Eve. Experience <span class=\"bb_strike\">me </span>crucial mome<span class=\"bb_strike\">nts </span> series of interspersed vignettes, and use what you learn to uncover the truth and survive the night.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal, non-linear presentation of an unsettling and dreamlike story concerning a man living with regrets\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harrowing original soundtrack and foley inspired by the modal jazz movement of the 1950s and 60s, uncanny demixes of classic folk and Americana samples and idioms, and chilling ambient synth soundscaping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphical elements reminiscent of late 90s and early 2000s horror titles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily stylized dialogue offering clues to piecing together the mysteries of the experience as memories spill into the present day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.poster.avif?t=1751180193\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.webm?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.mp4?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.poster.avif?t=1751180193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.webm?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.mp4?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.poster.avif?t=1751180193\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.webm?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/bf899c31958fcf0632140c09da801b28.mp4?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It\u2019s New Year's Eve tonight, you know. Calendar says so. Wonder what Benny\u2019s up to these days. Haven\u2019t seen him in ages. Haven\u2019t heard from him neither. Hope he\u2019s alright.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fourth Time Around</i>\u00a0is an experimental walking simulator in the style <span class=\"bb_strike\">of </span> You play as Henry, <span class=\"bb_strike\">an el\u00a0</span>suffering <span class=\"bb_strike\">fr </span>and must navigate a life-threatening home invasion on New Years Eve. Experience <span class=\"bb_strike\">me </span>crucial mome<span class=\"bb_strike\">nts </span> series of interspersed vignettes, and use what you learn to uncover the truth and survive the night.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal, non-linear presentation of an unsettling and dreamlike story concerning a man living with regrets\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harrowing original soundtrack and foley inspired by the modal jazz movement of the 1950s and 60s, uncanny demixes of classic folk and Americana samples and idioms, and chilling ambient synth soundscaping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphical elements reminiscent of late 90s and early 2000s horror titles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily stylized dialogue offering clues to piecing together the mysteries of the experience as memories spill into the present day</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.poster.avif?t=1751180193\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.webm?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/eabb19175cf96f88428d5842e8da1379.mp4?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.poster.avif?t=1751180193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.webm?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257350/extras/e7d5081ec67b094158ecf5a4a42f767f.mp4?t=1751180193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
